{
  "provider": "STUBA",
  "providerHotelId": "85315",
  "name": "Royal Benja Hotel",
  "starRating": 4,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RXLContentId",
      "text": "11776659"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "With a stay at Royal Benja Hotel in Bangkok (Sukhumvit), you\u0027ll be a 5-minute walk from Nana Square and 9 minutes by foot from Bumrungrad Hospital.  This spa hotel is 0.8 mi (1.3 km) from Terminal 21 Shopping Mall and 1.3 mi (2.1 km) from CentralWorld Shopping Complex."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 392 air-conditioned rooms featuring refrigerators and minibars. Flat-screen televisions with cable programming provide entertainment, while complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected. Private bathrooms have complimentary toiletries and bidets. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Relax at the full-service spa, where you can enjoy massages. You\u0027re sure to appreciate the recreational amenities, including an outdoor pool, a sauna, and a fitness center. This hotel also features complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and a hair salon."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003ENana Square - 0.4 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Bumrungrad Hospital - 0.7 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Central Embassy - 1.2 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Soi Cowboy - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Central Chidlom Department Store - 1.5 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Terminal 21 Shopping Mall - 1.5 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Erawan Shrine - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Embassy of the United States - 2 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Benjakitti Park - 2 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E CentralWorld Shopping Complex - 2.1 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Lumphini Park - 2.3 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Emporium - 2.4 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E EmQuartier - 2.5 km / 1.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Siam Square - 2.6 km / 1.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Siam Paragon Mall - 2.6 km / 1.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EDon Mueang Intl. Airport (DMK) - 26.8 km / 16.6 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Suvarnabhumi Intl. Airport (BKK) - 33.1 km / 20.5 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Royal Benja Hotel is Suvarnabhumi Intl. Airport (BKK). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards and cash\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECashless transactions are available\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher, a security system, and a first aid kit\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPlease note that cultural norms and guest policies may differ by country and by property; the policies listed are provided by the property\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003ENo pets and no service animals are allowed at this property. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECashless payment methods are available for all transactions.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EContactless check-in and contactless check-out are available.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAt check-in, guests must provide a negative PCR COVID-19 test result.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe negative COVID-19 test result requirement applies to all guests aged 18 and up, and the test must have been administered no more than 72 hours prior to check-in. \u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "For lunch or dinner, stop by Benjamas Restaurant, a restaurant that specializes in Thai cuisine. Dining is also available at the coffee shop/cafe, and 24-hour room service is provided. Quench your thirst with your favorite drink at the bar/lounge. Buffet breakfasts are available daily from 6 AM to 10 AM for a fee."
    }
  ],
